WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.586
Got something worth explaining?

00:00:03.215 --> 00:00:06.545
Type a topic, drop in a PDF, or paste a link.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.367
Inkcast doesn't just summarize.

00:00:09.438 --> 00:00:10.934
It designs a lesson:

00:00:11.319 --> 00:00:15.125
a hook, a real example, and the mistake people usually make.

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.802
Then it draws it, every stroke in sync with the voice.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:23.318
Choose the voice, the style, the shape.

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:24.724
Want a change?

00:00:25.237 --> 00:00:27.696
Just ask, and it redraws.

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:31.886
Download it, share a link, or host it yourself.

00:00:31.911 --> 00:00:33.325
It's open source.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:34.982
Inkcast.

00:00:35.123 --> 00:00:36.398
Type a topic.

00:00:36.539 --> 00:00:38.117
Watch it get drawn.
